:: Gwylan Pet Training
<<effects>><<if $NPCList[0]?.fullDescription isnot "Gwylan">><<npc Gwylan>><</if>><<person1>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<set _pool to shuffle(["sit", "stay", "paw", "fetch", "roll", "course", "tug"])>>
<<set $gwylan.training to { list: _pool.slice(0, 3), step: 0, score: 0, last: null, stopped: false }>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
	"Gwylan... could you give me a few commands?" you ask, thumb rubbing under the edge of your collar. "I want to see if I can get them right."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
	You rub the side of your neck and look at the collar instead of Gwylan. "Could you give me a few commands? I want to see if I can do them."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
	"Would you mind testing me?" you ask. "Three commands, if you have time."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
	You straighten your collar and step into the clear space between the shelves. "Three commands, Gwylan. Make them interesting."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You stop in front of Gwylan and wait for <<him>> to look up. "Tell me what to do. I'll try to do it right."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"Pick three commands," you say, tapping your collar. "I can handle them."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"Give me an order," you say, tugging at your collar. "See if you can find one I won't do."
<<else>>
	"Would you like to see what I've learned?" you ask, hooking a finger under your collar.
<</if>>
<br><br>
Gwylan looks up from the mortar. "Commands?" <<He>> sets the pestle down, trying and failing to look less pleased than <<hes>>.
"Oh, that's a lovely idea. Hold on, I know where I left the tin."
<br><br>
<<He>> fetches a flat tin from beneath the counter and rattles it beside your ear. The smell of candied ginger reaches you before the lid is even off.
<br><br>
"Three commands. Manage all three and your bed can stay out for the week. Two will do for tonight." <<He>> tilts the tin towards you.
"And if you want to stop, say so, and we stop. That's the only rule."
<br><br>
<<He>> steps out from behind the counter, onto the stretch of floor between the herb shelves where the boards have been worn pale.
Through the open door, the forest path is quiet.
<br><br>
Gwylan takes out a piece of ginger, holds it between two fingers, and waits for you to look at it.
<<if $hypnosis_traits.devotion gte 1>>
	<<hypnosisText "The rattle of the tin keeps going in your head after it stops, and your knees start to bend.">>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Wait for the first command|Gwylan Pet Training Round]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Think better of it|Forest Shop Entrance]]>><<unset $gwylan.training>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Gwylan Pet Training Round
<<effects>><<if $NPCList[0]?.fullDescription isnot "Gwylan">><<npc Gwylan>><</if>><<person1>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<set _wolf to effectiveTransformationLevel("wolf") gte 6>>
<<set _trick to $gwylan.training.list[$gwylan.training.step]>>
<<if $gwylan.training.step gt 0>>
	You get to your feet if you need to and return to the clear space between the shelves.
	Gwylan sets aside the last prop and comes over with the ginger tin.
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<switch _trick>>
	<<case "sit">>
		Gwylan crouches in front of you with the tin so <<he>> can reach you once you sit.
		Gwylan holds a piece of ginger between two fingers, level with your eyes, and waits until you are watching it. <<He>> lowers <<his>> hand a little.
		"<<gwylanCommand "Sit." 1>>"
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Sit at once|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "sit", cls: "eager" }>><<set $gwylan.training.score++>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<pass 2>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Sit, looking at the floor|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "sit", cls: "shy" }>><<set $gwylan.training.score++>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<pass 2>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<if _wolf>>
			<<link [[Sit the way your body wants to|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "sit", cls: "twist" }>><<set $gwylan.training.score++>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<pass 2>><</link>><<wolfgirl>>
		<<else>>
			<<link [[Sit slowly, eyes on <<him>>|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "sit", cls: "twist" }>><<set $gwylan.training.score++>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<npcincr Gwylan lust 1>><<pass 2>><</link>><<glust>>
		<</if>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Stay on your feet|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "sit", cls: "defy" }>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<pass 2>><</link>><<gwylanWillpowerDifficulty>>
	<<case "stay">>
		Gwylan crouches and sets a piece of ginger on the floorboards a few paces from you, then straightens and points at your feet.
		"<<gwylanCommand "Stay." 1>>"
		<br><br>
		<<He>> goes back behind the counter, opens the ledger, and does not look at you again.
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Hold still|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "stay", cls: "eager" }>><<set $gwylan.training.score++>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<pass 10>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Hold still, aware of the open door|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "stay", cls: "shy" }>><<set $gwylan.training.score++>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<pass 10>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Inch toward the ginger when <<he>> turns a page|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<if random(1, 2) is 1>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "stay", cls: "twist", ok: true }>><<set $gwylan.training.score++>><<else>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "stay", cls: "twist", ok: false }>><</if>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<pass 10>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Go straight for it|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "stay", cls: "defy" }>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<pass 2>><</link>><<gwylanWillpowerDifficulty>>
	<<case "paw">>
		Gwylan crouches in front of you, one hand held out, palm up.
		"<<gwylanCommand "Paw." 1>>"
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Put your hand in <<his>>|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "paw", cls: "eager" }>><<set $gwylan.training.score++>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<pass 2>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Offer your hand, looking away|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "paw", cls: "shy" }>><<set $gwylan.training.score++>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<pass 2>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Shake <<his>> hand, very formally|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "paw", cls: "twist" }>><<set $gwylan.training.score++>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<pass 2>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Keep your hands to yourself|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "paw", cls: "defy" }>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<pass 2>><</link>><<gwylanWillpowerDifficulty>>
	<<case "fetch">>
		Gwylan takes a ball of twine from beneath the counter and rolls it down the aisle between the herb shelves. It bumps against a crate at the far end and stops.
		<<He>> points after it. "<<gwylanCommand "Fetch." 1>>"
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Run after it and bring it back|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "fetch", cls: "eager" }>><<set $gwylan.training.score++>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<pass 3>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Fetch it, but walk, and hand it over without looking up|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "fetch", cls: "shy" }>><<set $gwylan.training.score++>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<pass 3>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<if _wolf>>
			<<link [[Run it down on instinct|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "fetch", cls: "twist" }>><<set $gwylan.training.score++>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<pass 3>><</link>><<wolfgirl>>
			<br>
		<<elseif hasSexStat("deviancy", 2)>>
			<<link [[Carry it back in your mouth|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "fetch", cls: "twist" }>><<set $gwylan.training.score++>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<npcincr Gwylan lust 2>><<sub 1>><<pass 3>><</link>><<glust>><<deviant2>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			<<link [[Make a show of it, sliding to a stop beside the crate|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "fetch", cls: "twist" }>><<set $gwylan.training.score++>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<pass 3>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<link [[Stay put and let it sit there|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "fetch", cls: "defy" }>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<pass 2>><</link>><<gwylanWillpowerDifficulty>>
	<<case "roll">>
		Gwylan looks at the clear floor beside the pet bed, then points down, the ginger still pinched between <<his>> fingers.
		"<<gwylanCommand "Roll over." 1>>"
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Roll over|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "roll", cls: "eager" }>><<set $gwylan.training.score++>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<pass 2>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Roll over, one arm across your front|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "roll", cls: "shy" }>><<set $gwylan.training.score++>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<pass 2>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<if _wolf>>
			<<link [[Roll over and stay there, belly bare|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "roll", cls: "twist" }>><<set $gwylan.training.score++>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<npcincr Gwylan lust 1>><<pass 2>><</link>><<wolfgirl>><<glust>>
			<br>
		<<elseif hasSexStat("deviancy", 2)>>
			<<link [[Roll over and stay on your back|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "roll", cls: "twist" }>><<set $gwylan.training.score++>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<npcincr Gwylan lust 2>><<sub 1>><<pass 2>><</link>><<glust>><<deviant2>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			<<link [[Roll over twice|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "roll", cls: "twist" }>><<set $gwylan.training.score++>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<pass 2>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<link [[Stay on your feet|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "roll", cls: "defy" }>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<pass 2>><</link>><<gwylanWillpowerDifficulty>>
	<<case "course">>
		Gwylan drags three crates and a stool into a line between the shelves and lays the stepladder across two of them for a bar.
		"Over, under and round, please. And do mind the jars. Several of them are very hard to replace."
		<br><br>
		<<athleticsdifficulty 1 600>>
		<<link [[Take it at a run|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<if $athleticsSuccess>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "course", cls: "eager", ok: true }>><<set $gwylan.training.score++>><<else>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "course", cls: "eager", ok: false }>><</if>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<pass 5>><<tiredness 1>><</link>><<gtiredness>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Pick your way through at a walk, watching the jars|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "course", cls: "shy" }>><<set $gwylan.training.score++>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<pass 5>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<if _wolf>>
			<<link [[Take it on all fours|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "course", cls: "twist", ok: true }>><<set $gwylan.training.score++>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<pass 5>><<tiredness 1>><</link>><<wolfgirl>><<gtiredness>>
		<<else>>
			<<link [[Vault the last crate|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<if random(1, 2) is 1>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "course", cls: "twist", ok: true }>><<set $gwylan.training.score++>><<else>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "course", cls: "twist", ok: false }>><</if>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<pass 5>><<tiredness 1>><</link>><<gtiredness>>
		<</if>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Walk around the whole thing|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "course", cls: "defy" }>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<pass 2>><</link>><<gwylanWillpowerDifficulty>>
	<<default>>
		<<He>> takes a length of knotted rope from under the counter and holds out one end. "Let's see how strong you are, then."
		You take the end <<he>> offers while <<he>> grips the other.
		<br><br>
		<<physiquedifficulty 1 9000>>
		<<link [[Pull with everything you have|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<if $physiqueSuccess>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "tug", cls: "eager", ok: true }>><<set $gwylan.training.score++>><<else>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "tug", cls: "eager", ok: false }>><</if>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<pass 5>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Pull, though it's hard to keep a straight face|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "tug", cls: "shy" }>><<set $gwylan.training.score++>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<pass 5>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<if _wolf>>
			<<link [[Bite the rope and growl|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "tug", cls: "twist" }>><<set $gwylan.training.score++>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<pass 5>><</link>><<wolfgirl>>
		<<else>>
			<<link [[Let Gwylan win|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "tug", cls: "twist" }>><<set $gwylan.training.score++>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<pass 5>><</link>>
		<</if>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Drop the rope|Gwylan Pet Training Result]]>><<set $gwylan.training.last to { trick: "tug", cls: "defy" }>><<set $gwylan.training.step++>><<pass 2>><</link>><<gwylanWillpowerDifficulty>>
<</switch>>
<br>
<<link [[Ask to stop training|Gwylan Pet Training End]]>><<set $gwylan.training.stopped to true>><</link>>
<br>

:: Gwylan Pet Training Result
<<effects>><<if $NPCList[0]?.fullDescription isnot "Gwylan">><<npc Gwylan>><</if>><<person1>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<include "Gwylan Pet Training React">>
<br><br>
<<if $gwylan.training.stopped or $gwylan.training.step gte 3>>
	<<link [[Next|Gwylan Pet Training End]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<link [[Next command|Gwylan Pet Training Round]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>

:: Gwylan Pet Training React
<<set _gs to _gwylanStatus ?? []>>
<<set _t to $gwylan.training.last.trick>>
<<set _c to $gwylan.training.last.cls>>
<<set _ok to $gwylan.training.last.ok>>
<<set _comp to (_c is "defy" and $hypnosis_traits.devotion gte 1 and !$willpowerSuccess and !_gs.includes("cautious"))>>
<<set _wolfLv to effectiveTransformationLevel("wolf") gte 6>>
<<switch _t>>
	<<case "sit">>
		<<if _c is "eager">>
			You sit before Gwylan has finished the word. <<He>> brings the ginger to your mouth, and the sugar gives way to a slow warmth as you chew.
			"<<pcPetname "Gwylan" "good">>."
			<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
				<br><br>
				"Was that all right?" you ask once you have swallowed.
				<br><br>
				Gwylan taps the tin. "You were sitting before I'd finished speaking, so yes, I think it was."
			<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
				<br><br>
				"Thank you," you say.
				<br><br>
				Gwylan nods and reaches into the tin again.
			<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
				<br><br>
				"A good start," you say, lifting your chin.
				<br><br>
				Gwylan points the ginger at you. "I'll do the marking, if you don't mind, dear."
			<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
				<br><br>
				You stay sitting after you swallow, hands resting in your lap.
				Gwylan reaches for another piece of ginger, then remembers there are more commands to go.
			<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
				<br><br>
				"One done," you say. "What's next?"
			<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
				<br><br>
				"That was easy," you say. "Give me a real one."
				<br><br>
				Gwylan lowers the tin, amused. "Mmn. Let's see how you manage the next one first."
			<</if>>
		<<elseif _c is "shy">>
			You sit, but you can't make yourself look up. <<He>> holds the ginger in front of your face a few seconds longer than <<he>> needs to,
			and the tips of your ears go hot.<<if ["wolf", "cat", "cow", "fox", "bunny", "bear", "waterdragon", "kitsune", "okami"].some(tf => Transformations.partActive(tf, "ears"))>> They twitch away from the tin.<</if>>
		<<elseif _c is "twist">>
			<<if _wolfLv>>
				Your knees bend before you decide how to sit, dropping you low in front of <<him>> with your back straight and chin up.
				<<if Transformations.partActive("wolf", "tail")>>Your tail sweeps across the floorboards behind you.<</if>>
				<br><br>
				Gwylan presses the back of <<his>> wrist to <<his>> mouth. "Oh, dear! That's unfair..." <<He>> feeds you the ginger and scratches behind your ear;
				you tip your head into <<his>> fingers before you catch yourself. <<trauma -3>><<ltrauma>>
			<<else>>
				You lower yourself slowly, keeping your eyes on <<him>> all the way down. Gwylan watches you, a little pink, before putting the ginger on your tongue. "Oh, you're showing off."
			<</if>>
		<<elseif _comp>>
			You keep your feet in place and force yourself to stay standing, even as your legs begin to ache. <<gwylanHypnoName "cap">> tilts <<his>> head, and <span class="red">your legs give way beneath you</span>.
			<br><br>
			<<hypnosisText "You are sitting before you can stop yourself.">> Gwylan waits until you look up before offering the ginger.
		<<else>>
			You stay on your feet. Gwylan looks at you for a moment, then eats the ginger <<himself>> with a small shrug.
		<</if>>
	<<case "stay">>
		<<if _c is "eager">>
			Minutes go by. Gwylan keeps reading, though every few lines <<he>> glances at you.
			<<if ["wolf", "cat", "cow", "fox", "bunny", "bear", "bird", "waterdragon", "demon", "kitsune", "okami"].some(tf => Transformations.partActive(tf, "tail"))>>Your tail keeps moving behind you each time the smell of ginger drifts over, and you can't make it stop.<</if>>
			<br><br>
			When <<he>> finally closes the ledger, <<he>> looks at the untouched ginger and raises <<his>> eyebrows. "Not a crumb moved. I may have made that one too easy."
		<<elseif _c is "shy">>
			The shop door is open to the forest path, and every footstep outside makes you flinch. Gwylan keeps reading without looking up.
			<br><br>
			By the time <<he>> closes the ledger, nobody has come in, the ginger is still where <<he>> left it, and your shoulders are up around your ears.
		<<elseif _c is "twist" and _ok>>
			<<He>> turns a page. You edge closer. When <<he>> turns another, you reach the ginger and put it in your mouth.
			<br><br>
			Gwylan keeps reading. "I did say <i>stay</i>," <<he>> says mildly.
		<<elseif _c is "twist">>
			A floorboard creaks as you edge towards the ginger. "Back, please," Gwylan says, without lifting <<his>> eyes from the ledger.
			<br><br>
			<<He>> gets up, crosses the shop, and nudges the ginger back to where it started with the toe of <<his>> boot, then waits until you have returned to your spot. Your ears are burning.
		<<elseif _comp>>
			You mean to grab it. Your legs stay exactly where they are, and you can smell the ginger the entire time.
			<br><br>
			<<hypnosisText "You want it badly, and you cannot make your hand move.">>
		<<else>>
			You cross the floor in three strides and close your hand around the ginger.
			<br><br>
			Gwylan watches you over the top of the ledger and bursts out laughing. "I'd have been disappointed if you hadn't tried it once.
			Not like that, though."
		<</if>>
	<<case "paw">>
		<<if _c is "eager">>
			You put your hand in <<his>> as soon as <<he>> asks. Gwylan closes <<his>> fingers around it for a moment, turns your palm over,
			then pats your knuckles and lets go.
		<<elseif _c is "shy">>
			You give <<him>> your hand but not your eyes. <<His>> fingers are warm and dry, and <<he>> turns your hand over to look at the palm.
		<<elseif _c is "twist">>
			<<He>> gives your hand a shake. "A pleasure doing business."
			<br><br>
			<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
				"Likewise," you say, returning the shake just as seriously.
				<br><br>
				Gwylan nods once and lets go of your hand.
			<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
				You give <<his>> hand an extra shake before letting go. "Very professional."
				<br><br>
				Gwylan drops the serious face and starts laughing.
			<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
				"You said paw. You never said how," you say.
				<br><br>
				Gwylan nods. "I'll word that one better next time."
			<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
				You squeeze <<his>> hand once. "There. Happy?"
				<br><br>
				Gwylan gives your hand another firm shake. "Very. You even shook on it."
			<<else>>
				"Likewise, I'm sure," you say, and <<he>> laughs too hard to keep hold of your hand.
			<</if>>
		<<elseif _comp>>
			You mean to keep your hands where they are, but <span class="red">your right hand rises before you can stop it</span>.
			Gwylan holds out <<his>> hand, and your fingers close around it before you can pull back. <<He>> watches for a moment, then lets go.
			<br><br>
			<<hypnosisText "You move the moment <<he>> asks, and obeying gives you a rush of pleasure.">>
		<<else>>
			You fold your arms. Gwylan lets <<his>> hand fall to <<his>> knee.
		<</if>>
	<<case "fetch">>
		<<if _c is "eager">>
			You run down the aisle, scoop up the ball of twine beside the crate and bring it back at a jog.
			<br><br>
			Gwylan takes it from you, winds the loose end back around the ball and gives you the ginger.
		<<elseif _c is "shy">>
			You walk down the aisle, pick the twine up, and carry it back, holding it away from your body.
			<br><br>
			You hand it over without looking up, and Gwylan accepts it with both hands and a small bow.
		<<elseif _c is "twist">>
			<<if _wolfLv>>
				You rush down the aisle and reach the twine beside the far shelf.
				By the time you realise what you have done, you are on all fours with the ball between your teeth.
				<br><br>
				<<if Transformations.partActive("wolf", "tail")>>Your tail is wagging hard.<</if>>
				Gwylan grips the counter and laughs. "You didn't even think about that, did you?"
			<<elseif hasSexStat("deviancy", 2)>>
				You scoop the ball up with your mouth and carry it back like that, jaw aching a little.
				Gwylan takes it from your teeth, looks at the damp twine, then wipes it on a cloth without comment.
			<<else>>
				You skid to a stop beside the crate, scoop up the twine and race back out of breath.
				<br><br>
				Gwylan rattles the ginger tin in quick applause.
			<</if>>
		<<elseif _comp>>
			You mean to stay where you are. <<hypnosisText "Your legs carry you after it regardless.">>
			<br><br>
			By the time you stop moving, you are back in front of Gwylan with the twine in your hand.
		<<else>>
			You leave the twine where it stopped. Gwylan waits a few seconds, then walks down the aisle and picks it up <<himself>>.
			<br><br>
			"No fetch, then." <<He>> puts it back under the counter and reaches for the tin again.
		<</if>>
	<<case "roll">>
		<<if _c is "eager">>
			You go over on your back and come up again with dust on your shoulders. Gwylan applauds, once, and bows when you look.
		<<elseif _c is "shy">>
			You roll, and keep one arm across your front the whole way over. Gwylan studies the cuckoo clock until you are back on your feet.
		<<elseif _c is "twist">>
			<<if _wolfLv>>
				You roll onto your back and stay there with your stomach exposed.<<if Transformations.partActive("wolf", "tail")>>
				Your tail thumps the boards.<</if>><br><br>Gwylan smiles down at you. "Oh, you are shameless."
			<<elseif hasSexStat("deviancy", 2)>>
				You roll onto your back and stay there. A small whine slips out when Gwylan kneels beside you and presses two fingers to the middle of your chest.
				<br><br>
				Your back lifts from the boards before you can stop it. "Oh, <<pcpetname "Gwylan" "my">>," <<he>> says, keeping <<his>> hand there a moment longer.
				<<arousal 300>><<garousal>>
			<<else>>
				You roll over twice and sit up again. Gwylan points at you with the ginger.
				<br><br>
				"I only asked for one." <<Hes>> already laughing when <<he>> gives it to you.
			<</if>>
		<<elseif _comp>>
			You brace your legs to stay upright, but the command pulls you into the movement anyway. <<hypnosisText "You roll onto your back before you can stop yourself.">>
			<br><br>
			Gwylan waits for you to sit up again before offering a hand.
		<<else>>
			You stay on your feet until Gwylan lowers <<his>> hand.
			<br><br>
			"No? All right." <<He>> puts the ginger back in the tin.
		<</if>>
	<<case "course">>
		<<if _c is "eager" and _ok>>
			You take the stool in one stride, duck under the ladder and swing around the last crate without touching a jar.
			Gwylan is counting on <<his>> fingers when you come back.
			<br><br>
			"Eleven seconds," <<he>> says. "I started counting after the stool."
			<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "confident" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
				<br><br>
				"You were absolutely timing me," you say.
				<br><br>
				Gwylan looks at <<his>> raised hand and slowly closes it. "I got curious, dear."
			<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
				<br><br>
				"Set it up again," you say. "I can beat that."
				<br><br>
				Gwylan eyes the jars. "Once is plenty. I'd like them to see tomorrow."
			<</if>>
		<<elseif _c is "eager">>
			You clip the ladder going under, and the whole row of jars chimes. Gwylan lunges and gets a hand around the one that tips.
			<br><br>
			"Mine," <<he>> says, hugging it, "and I'm very fond of it. Again, slower, please."
		<<elseif _c is "shy">>
			You pick your way through at a walk, watching the jars as much as the open door.
			<br><br>
			Gwylan sits on the counter with <<his>> chin in <<his>> hand and lets you take as long as you need.
		<<elseif _c is "twist" and _wolfLv>>
			You drop to all fours and rush the course before you have time to think about it.
			You clear the stool, duck beneath the ladder and round the last crate on your hands and feet.<<if Transformations.partActive("wolf", "tail")>>
			<br><br>
			Your tail swings high behind you as you finish.<</if>> Gwylan has both hands over <<his>> mouth when you look back.
		<<elseif _c is "twist" and _ok>>
			You vault the last crate and land on your feet. Gwylan rattles the tin once and hands you the ginger. "That one counts."
		<<elseif _c is "twist">>
			You try to vault the last crate, catch it with your foot and hit the floor. Gwylan is beside you before you can get up.
			<br><br>
			"Anything hurt?" <<He>> checks your arm when you shake your head, then helps you to your feet.
			"Perhaps leave the vaulting for another day."
		<<elseif _comp>>
			You turn to walk around the course, but your feet carry you towards the stool instead.
			<br><br>
			<<hypnosisText "The command keeps you on the course even while you try to leave it.">> You go over, under and round as ordered,
			only stopping once you reach the end.
		<<else>>
			You walk around the whole course instead.
			<br><br>
			Gwylan watches you return to the starting point, then puts the ginger back in the tin. "You went around it, dear. That isn't quite the course."
		<</if>>
	<<default>>
		<<if _c is "eager" and _ok>>
			You plant your feet and haul. The rope slips through Gwylan's hands, and <<he>> stumbles forward onto the floor.
			<<He>> sits there laughing for a second before dropping the rope.
			<br><br>
			"All right. You win." <<He>> rubs the red marks across <<his>> palms. "I was going to let you have it eventually."
			<br><br>
			<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile")>>
				"Of course you were," you say, offering <<him>> a hand.
			<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident")>>
				You bow over the rope. "A gracious defeat."
				<br><br>
				You offer your hand, and Gwylan lets you pull <<him>> up. "You look very pleased with yourself."
			<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
				"You went down very easily," you say.
				<br><br>
				Gwylan grabs your end of the rope and gives it a sudden tug, making you stumble a step forward. "Say that again when I'm standing."
			<<else>>
				"No, you weren't," you say.
				<br><br>
				You offer your hand, and Gwylan gets up without arguing.
			<</if>>
		<<elseif _c is "eager">>
			You haul with everything you have, but Gwylan leans back and holds <<his>> ground.
			<br><br>
			When your arms finally give out, <<he>> pulls you closer along the rope until you are within reach, then pats the top of your head.
			"Nearly had me."
		<<elseif _c is "shy">>
			You pull, but not hard. By the time Gwylan starts reeling you in, your face is hot and you can barely look at <<him>>.
			<br><br>
			<<He>> lets the rope go before you reach <<him>>. "We'll call that one a draw."
		<<elseif _c is "twist" and _wolfLv>>
			You bite down on the rope and jerk your head from side to side. A growl comes out with it, and Gwylan lets go in surprise.
			<br><br>
			You keep growling after the rope drops.<<if Transformations.partActive("wolf", "tail")>> Your tail slaps the floorboards behind you.<</if>>
		<<elseif _c is "twist">>
			You pull hard at first, then loosen your grip as Gwylan leans back. <<He>> pulls more of the rope towards <<him>> and notices what you are doing.
			<<if C.npc.Gwylan.dom gte 50>>
				"You let me win." <<He>> draws you closer with the rope until you are standing in front of <<him>>. "I saw you loosen your grip."
			<<else>>
				"Did you let me win?" Gwylan asks, staring at your hands on the rope. <<He>> starts laughing before you answer.
			<</if>>
		<<elseif _comp>>
			You drop the rope, but your hand closes around it again before you can step away.
			<br><br>
			By the time you realise what you're doing, it's between your teeth. <<hypnosisText "You don't remember choosing to do any of that.">>
		<<else>>
			You drop the rope. Gwylan looks at it, then at you, and winds it up without a word.
		<</if>>
<</switch>>
<br><br>
<<if _c is "shy">>
	<<if !_gs.includes("cautious") and (C.npc.Gwylan.dom gte 50 or _gs.includesAny("dom", "lust"))>>
		Gwylan notices you keep looking at the floor and smiles. "You've gone red right up to the ears."
		<br><br>
		<<He>> holds out another piece of ginger, but keeps it just out of reach. "Look at me first, dear." <<npcincr Gwylan dom 1>><<stress 3>><<gstress>>
	<<elseif _gs.includes("cautious")>>
		Gwylan lowers the tin. "Is that too much?" <<He>> waits for your answer before moving again. "We can stop whenever you like."
	<<else>>
		Gwylan waits until you finally look up, then passes you another piece of ginger. "You did well." <<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<</if>>
<<elseif _c is "defy">>
	<<if _comp>>
		<<trauma 1>><<gtrauma>>
	<<elseif _gs.includes("cautious")>>
		<<set $gwylan.training.stopped to true>>
		Gwylan puts the lid back on the tin. "That's quite all right. We'll stop there." <<He>> sets it aside and gives you room to move away.
	<<elseif C.npc.Gwylan.dom gte 50>>
		Gwylan grins. "There you are. I was wondering when you'd start arguing." <<He>> puts the ginger back in the tin.
	<<elseif $gwylanSeen.includes("romance")>>
		<<He>> presses a hand to <<his>> chest. "Cruel, <<pcpetname "Gwylan" "name">>. So cruel to your poor Gwylan." <<Hes>> already smiling.
	<<else>>
		"No? All right," <<he>> says mildly, and puts the ginger back in the tin.
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Gwylan Pet Training End
<<effects>><<if $NPCList[0]?.fullDescription isnot "Gwylan">><<npc Gwylan>><</if>><<person1>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<set _score to ($gwylan.training and $gwylan.training.score) ?? 0>>
<<set _stopped to ($gwylan.training and $gwylan.training.stopped) ? true : false>>
<<set $daily.gwylan.training to true>>
<<set $gwylanSeen.pushUnique("pet_training")>>
<<if _stopped>>
	Gwylan clears the floor without a fuss, coiling the rope and stacking the crates back against the wall.
	The pet bed stays where it is.<<if $gwylan.training.tier isnot "stopped">><<stress -2>><</if>><<set $gwylan.training.tier to "stopped">><<lstress>>
<<elseif _score gte 3>>
	<<if $gwylan.training.tier isnot "three">><<set $gwylan.timer.petBed to new DateTime(Math.max(Time.date.timeStamp, $gwylan.timer.petBed || 0)).addDays(7).timeStamp>><</if>>
	Gwylan counts the three commands off on <<his>> fingers, then tips several pieces of ginger into your palm.
	<br><br>
	"All three. Your bed can stay out for <span class="blue">a week</span>." <<He>> closes the tin and tucks it under one arm.
	"Do come and ask me again before then, if you like."
	<<if $gwylan.training.tier isnot "three">><<stress -6>><<trauma -2>><</if>><<set $gwylan.training.tier to "three">><<lstress>><<ltrauma>>
<<elseif _score is 2>>
	<<if $gwylan.training.tier isnot "two">><<set $gwylan.timer.petBed to new DateTime(Math.max(Time.date.timeStamp, $gwylan.timer.petBed || 0)).addDays(1).timeStamp>><</if>>
	"Two out of three," Gwylan says, patting your head. "That's a good effort. Your bed can stay out for <span class="blue">one more night</span>,
	but do practise the one you skipped."
	<<if $gwylan.training.tier isnot "two">><<stress -3>><</if>><<set $gwylan.training.tier to "two">><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	<<set $gwylan.training.tier to "none">>
	Gwylan closes the tin and puts it away before looking back at you.
	<br><br>
	"That's all right. Not every day goes well." <<He>> pushes the pet bed back into place with <<his>> foot. "Try again tomorrow, if you'd like to."
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Gwylan Pet Training Wrap]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Gwylan Pet Training Wrap
<<effects>><<if $NPCList[0]?.fullDescription isnot "Gwylan">><<npc Gwylan>><</if>><<person1>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<set _tier to $gwylan.training.tier>>
<<unset $gwylan.training>>
<<switch _tier>>
	<<case "stopped">>
		<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
			"Sorry. I thought I'd be able to keep going," you say when Gwylan turns back.
			<br><br>
			<<He>> shakes <<his>> head and pushes the tin farther under the counter. "You said stop. That's all I needed to hear."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
			"I'd like to try again another day," you say.
			<br><br>
			Gwylan nods. "Then another day it is."
		<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
			"I said stop. That doesn't mean you won," you say.
			<br><br>
			Gwylan laughs and slides the tin out of sight. "I'll make a note of that."
		<<else>>
			Gwylan hangs the rope back on its hook. "Whenever you want another go, I'm here."
		<</if>>
	<<case "three">>
		<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
			"I got all three?" you ask, looking down at the ginger in your palm.
			<br><br>
			Gwylan closes your fingers around it. "All three. You can stop looking so surprised."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
			"Thank you. I enjoyed that," you say.
			<br><br>
			Gwylan puts the tin away. "So did I. Ask me again tomorrow, if you'd like to."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
			"You'll need harder commands next time," you say.
			<br><br>
			Gwylan shuts the tin and slips it under the counter. "All right. Harder ones next time."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
			You close your hand around the ginger. "I'll do it again if you want me to."
			<br><br>
			Gwylan's smile widens. "Oh, I do."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
			"Told you I could do it," you say.
			<br><br>
			Gwylan takes one of the pieces back out of your palm, studies it, then puts it back. "Three. I counted."
		<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
			"That was your best three?" you ask.
			<br><br>
			Gwylan taps a finger against the tin's lid. "Those were the easy ones. If you come back, I'll think of something harder."
			<<He>> puts the tin away.
		<<else>>
			You eat a piece of the ginger. Gwylan watches you do it, looking very pleased with <<himself>>.
		<</if>>
		<<if $hypnosis_traits.devotion gte 1>>
			<br><br>
			<<hypnosisText "Gwylan's praise stays in your head, and you find yourself waiting to hear it again.">>
		<</if>>
	<<case "two">>
		<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
			"I nearly had all three," you say.
			<br><br>
			"You nearly did." Gwylan nudges the ginger tin towards you, then pulls it back when you reach for it. "Not until tomorrow."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
			"I'll practise," you say.
			<br><br>
			Gwylan nudges the pet bed with <<his>> foot. "Then show me tomorrow."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
			"One bad command out of three isn't terrible," you say.
			<br><br>
			"No," Gwylan says, closing the tin. "But I know which one to try on you again."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
			"Which one should I practise?" you ask.
			<br><br>
			"The one you skipped." Gwylan taps your collar with one finger. "I'd like to see you get it right next time."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
			"Next time it'll be three," you say.
			<br><br>
			Gwylan smiles and puts the tin away. "Then come back and show me."
		<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
			"Two should still get me ginger," you say, reaching for the tin.
			<br><br>
			Gwylan moves it behind <<his>> back before you can reach it. "Two earns the bed for tonight. The ginger is for three, I'm afraid."
		<<else>>
			Gwylan slides the tin under the counter. "Practise the one you skipped, and come back when you're ready."
		<</if>>
	<<default>>
		<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
			"I did try," you say, looking down.
			<br><br>
			"I know." Gwylan touches the top of your head, then leaves <<his>> hand there until you look up. "That's why I'm happy to let you try again."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
			"I'll do better next time," you say.
			<br><br>
			Gwylan points towards the pet bed. "Get some rest first. I'd like you awake when I test you again."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
			"Bad round," you say, straightening your collar. "I'll fix that tomorrow."
			<br><br>
			Gwylan grins and taps the counter with <<his>> palm. "I'll be here."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
			"What do you want me to practise?" you ask.
			<br><br>
			Gwylan looks at you for a second, then points to the pet bed. "Rest first. We can do the commands again tomorrow."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
			"Again tomorrow," you say.
			<br><br>
			Gwylan slides the tin under the counter. "I'll save the ginger."
		<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
			"You picked bad commands," you say.
			<br><br>
			Gwylan pauses with the tin halfway under the counter. "Did I? We can try those same ones again tomorrow."
		<<else>>
			Gwylan hangs the rope on its hook and goes back to the mortar.
		<</if>>
<</switch>>
<br><br>
<<gwylanOptions>>

:: Gwylan Supper
<<effects>><<if $NPCList[0]?.fullDescription isnot "Gwylan">><<npc Gwylan>><</if>><<person1>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<set _gs to _gwylanStatus ?? []>>
<<set $daily.gwylan.supper to true>>
<<set $gwylan.supper to { mode: "" }>>
Gwylan glances at the cuckoo clock, then at you. "It's gone suppertime, and I don't think you've eaten. Sit down, please." <<Hes>> through to the back room before you can answer.
You hear a cupboard open and a bowl set down on the worktop.
<br><br>
<<He>> comes back carrying your bowl in both hands. It is full of barley, chopped roots and torn bread in thick broth, still steaming.
<<if $gwylanSeen.includes("dog_bowl_name")>>
	The gems around the rim catch the lamplight, with your name set into the side facing you.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if _gs.includes("cautious")>>
	<<He>> sets it on the little table with a spoon beside it and steps back. "Eat however you like. I only wanted you fed." <<He>> waits to see what you choose.
<<elseif C.npc.Gwylan.dom gte 50 or _gs.includes("dom")>>
	<<He>> sets it down on the mat by the counter rather than the table and leaves a spoon beside it. "There's a spoon, if you want it."
<<else>>
	<<He>> sets it on the little table and puts a spoon beside it. "Mind the heat."
<</if>>
<<if Transformations.partActive("wolf", "tail")>>
	Your tail wags once before you force it still.
<<elseif ["cat", "cow", "fox", "bunny", "bear", "bird", "waterdragon", "demon", "kitsune", "okami"].some(tf => Transformations.partActive(tf, "tail"))>>
	Your tail moves behind you as the smell of supper reaches you.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Take the spoon and eat like a person|Gwylan Supper Eat]]>><<set $gwylan.supper.mode to "spoon">><<run foodApplyFullness(3, 4)>><<pass 20>><<stress -2>><</link>><<lstress>>
<br>
<<if hasSexStat("deviancy", 2)>>
	<<link [[Lower your face to the bowl|Gwylan Supper Eat]]>><<set $gwylan.supper.mode to "pet">><<set $gwylanSeen.pushUnique("petplay")>><<run foodApplyFullness(3, 4)>><<pass 20>><<stress -3>><<npcincr Gwylan lust 3>><</link>><<deviant2>><<lstress>><<gglust>>
<<else>>
	<<insufficientStat "deviancy" "to eat from the bowl like a pet">>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[Keep your hands in your lap until Gwylan says you may|Gwylan Supper Eat]]>><<set $gwylan.supper.mode to "wait">><<run foodApplyFullness(3, 4)>><<pass 20>><</link>><<gwylanWillpowerDifficulty>>
<br>
<<if $gwylanSeen.includesAny("romance", "partners") or _gs.includes("lust")>>
	<<link [[Ask to be fed by hand|Gwylan Supper Eat]]>><<set $gwylan.supper.mode to "hand">><<run foodApplyFullness(3, 4)>><<pass 20>><<stress -4>><<npcincr Gwylan lust 2>><</link>><<lstress>><<glust>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if !bloatedActive() and foodWouldBloat(3)>><span class="red">Eating supper will make you bloated.</span><br><</if>>

:: Gwylan Supper Eat
<<effects>><<if $NPCList[0]?.fullDescription isnot "Gwylan">><<npc Gwylan>><</if>><<person1>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>><<speechresolve>>
<<set _gs to _gwylanStatus ?? []>>
<<set _mode to $gwylan.supper.mode>>
<<switch _mode>>
	<<case "spoon">>
		You <<if !_gs.includes("cautious") and (C.npc.Gwylan.dom gte 50 or _gs.includes("dom"))>>sit on the mat<<else>>sit at the table<</if>>, take the spoon and eat normally. The bread has soaked up the broth and breaks apart under the spoon.
		Gwylan drinks from <<his>> mug instead of watching every mouthful.
		<br><br>
		<<if _gs.includes("cautious")>>
			"All right?" <<he>> asks, once. When you nod, <<he>> leaves you to it.
		<<elseif C.npc.Gwylan.dom gte 50 or _gs.includes("dom")>>
			"The spoon tonight," <<he>> says, eyeing it with mild interest. "I wondered what you'd choose."
		<<else>>
			Gwylan sits across from you with a mug. "Save some bread for the end. It soaks up all the broth."
		<</if>>
	<<case "pet">>
		You <<if !_gs.includes("cautious") and (C.npc.Gwylan.dom gte 50 or _gs.includes("dom"))>>kneel on the mat<<else>>sit at the table<</if>>, lower your face to the bowl and eat directly from it. Warm broth wets your chin, and a piece of barley sticks to your lip until you lick it away.
		<<if $hypnosis_traits.devotion gte 3>>
			<<hypnosisText "A warm rush goes through your chest. You are being good, and Gwylan is watching you do it.">>
		<</if>>
		<<if Transformations.partActive("wolf", "tail")>>
			Your tail thumps slowly on the floor. Gwylan watches it and starts to smile.
		<<elseif ["cat", "cow", "fox", "bunny", "bear", "bird", "waterdragon", "demon", "kitsune", "okami"].some(tf => Transformations.partActive(tf, "tail"))>>
			Your tail shifts behind you. Gwylan notices and starts to smile.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<if _gs.includes("cautious")>>
			Gwylan crouches where you can see <<him>>. "You can pick the spoon up whenever you want," <<he>> says.
		<<elseif C.npc.Gwylan.dom gte 50 or _gs.includes("dom")>>
			Gwylan crouches beside you and keeps one hand at the back of your head. "Slowly, <<pcpetname "Gwylan" "simple">>. You have the whole bowl."
		<<else>>
			Gwylan covers <<his>> mouth when you glance up. "Oh. Oh, you are lovely," <<he>> says through <<his>> fingers. "Don't forget the crust."
		<</if>>
	<<case "wait">>
		You <<if !_gs.includes("cautious") and (C.npc.Gwylan.dom gte 50 or _gs.includes("dom"))>>sit on the mat<<else>>sit at the table<</if>> and fold your hands in your lap, looking at the bowl while steam rises past your face.
		<br><br>
		<<if $hypnosis_traits.devotion gte 1 and !$willpowerSuccess>>
			<<hypnosisText "You cannot make yourself reach for the spoon until Gwylan gives you permission.">>
			Gwylan watches you for another few seconds, then points at the bowl. "All right. Eat."
			<<npcincr Gwylan dom 1>>
		<<else>>
			You keep your hands in your lap until Gwylan notices you waiting and says, "Go on, eat." By then your stomach is aching,
			and you start eating so quickly that <<he>> laughs and pushes the bread nearer.
		<</if>>
	<<case "hand">>
		<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
			"Gwylan... would you feed me?" you ask, looking at the bowl instead of <<him>>.
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
			You rub your thumb over your fingers. "Could you... feed me?"
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
			"Would you mind feeding me?" you ask, nudging the bowl towards <<him>>.
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
			You nudge the bowl towards <<him>> and open your mouth expectantly. "You made supper. Finish the job."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
			You sit closer and fold your hands in your lap. "You can feed me, if you want."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
			"Feed me," you say, moving the bowl towards <<him>>.
		<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
			"You've gone this far," you say, pushing the bowl into <<his>> hands. "Feed me too."
		<<else>>
			"Will you feed me?" you ask.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		Gwylan looks at you, then down at the bowl. "Oh. Come here, then." <<He>> sits on the floor and pulls you closer before settling the bowl in <<his>> lap.
		The bread is torn into smaller pieces, and <<he>> blows on every spoonful before bringing it to your mouth.
		<br><br>
		Halfway through, a drop of broth reaches your chin. <<He>> wipes it away with <<his>> thumb, pauses when you look at <<him>>, then reaches for the next spoonful.
		<<if _gs.includes("cautious")>>
			<br><br>
			"Still all right?" <<he>> asks. When you nod, <<he>> blows on the next spoonful and carries on.
		<</if>>
<</switch>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Gwylan Supper Done]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Gwylan Supper Done
<<effects>><<if $NPCList[0]?.fullDescription isnot "Gwylan">><<npc Gwylan>><</if>><<person1>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<set _gs to _gwylanStatus ?? []>>
<<set _mode to $gwylan.supper.mode>>
<<unset $gwylan.supper>>
<<switch _mode>>
	<<case "spoon">>
		<<if _gs.includes("cautious")>>
			When you finish, Gwylan takes the empty bowl without comment and carries it away.
		<<else>>
			The two of you finish without hurrying, and Gwylan carries the empty bowl away.
		<</if>>
	<<case "pet">>
		<<if _gs.includes("cautious")>>
			Gwylan sits back on <<his>> heels while you finish, then takes the bowl once it is clean.
		<<elseif C.npc.Gwylan.dom gte 50 or _gs.includes("dom")>>
			Gwylan takes the clean bowl away and wipes your chin with a cloth.
		<<else>>
			When the bowl is clean, Gwylan collects it with a pleased little sigh.
		<</if>>
	<<case "wait">>
		<<if _gs.includes("cautious")>>
			Afterwards, Gwylan takes the bowl from you. "You don't have to wait for me next time," <<he>> says. "Unless you want to."
		<<elseif ["wolf", "cat", "cow", "fox", "bunny", "bear", "waterdragon", "kitsune", "okami"].some(tf => Transformations.partActive(tf, "ears"))>>
			Your ears twitch towards Gwylan when <<he>> speaks. "You waited so patiently," <<he>> says, taking the empty bowl to rinse in the basin.
		<<else>>
			Gwylan takes the empty bowl and rinses it in the basin.
		<</if>>
	<<default>>
		Gwylan keeps going until the bowl is empty, then sets it aside and leaves you leaning against <<his>> shoulder for a minute longer.
<</switch>>
<br><br>
<<gwylanOptions>>

:: Gwylan Wash
<<effects>><<if $NPCList[0]?.fullDescription isnot "Gwylan">><<npc Gwylan>><</if>><<person1>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<set _gs to _gwylanStatus ?? []>>
<<set $daily.gwylan.wash to true>>
Gwylan checks your hair and hands for leaves and mud. "Come through to the back, dear. Let's see what needs washing."
<br><br>
<<He>> puts a tin basin on the floor and brings over a jug of warm water, rosemary soap, a comb and an old towel, then tests the water with two fingers.
"Clothes stay on, I think. I can do your face, hands, hair and neck."
<br><br>
<<link [[Wash up yourself|Gwylan Wash Done]]>><<set $gwylan.wash to "self">><<pass 10>><<stress -2>><</link>><<lstress>>
<br>
<<if $gwylanSeen.includes("petplay") or _gs.includes("dom") or _gs.includes("lust")>>
	<<link [[Let Gwylan wash your hair and neck|Gwylan Wash Done]]>><<set $gwylan.wash to "hair">><<pass 10>><<stress -4>><</link>><<lstress>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if ["wolf", "cat", "cow", "fox", "bunny", "bear", "kitsune", "okami"].some(tf => Transformations.partActive(tf, "ears") or Transformations.partActive(tf, "tail"))>>
	<<link [[Let Gwylan brush the tangles out of your fur|Gwylan Wash Done]]>><<set $gwylan.wash to "fur">><<pass 15>><<stress -4>><</link>><<lstress>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Gwylan Wash Done
<<effects>><<if $NPCList[0]?.fullDescription isnot "Gwylan">><<npc Gwylan>><</if>><<person1>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>><<speechresolve>>
<<set _gs to _gwylanStatus ?? []>><<wash_face>><<wash_hands>>
<<switch $gwylan.wash>>
	<<case "self">>
		You wash your face and hands first, then work the soap through your hair. By the second rinse the water runs clear.
		Gwylan passes you the towel, then plucks one last leaf from the back of your hair and holds it up. "Missed one."
		<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
			<br><br>
			"Thanks for the water," you say.
			<br><br>
			Gwylan takes the wet towel from you and hangs it over the side of the basin.
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
			<br><br>
			You pull the towel around your shoulders and shake your damp hair back. "There. Presentable again."
			<br><br>
			Gwylan reaches over and removes another leaf from behind your ear.
		<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
			<br><br>
			You snatch the towel from <<him>>. "Stop inspecting me."
			<br><br>
			Gwylan lets you have it, still holding the leaf <<he>> found in your hair.
		<</if>>
	<<case "hair">>
		You sit on the floor with the basin behind you. Gwylan kneels at your back and supports your neck as you tip your head over the basin.
		The first cup of warm water makes you shut your eyes.
		<<His>> fingers work the soap through your hair and around your scalp, taking more time around your ears. For a while, <<he>> stops talking.
		<br><br>
		<<if $hypnosis_traits.devotion gte 1>>
			<<hypnosisText "Your shoulders loosen under <<his>> hands, and you lean back whenever <<he>> guides your head.">>
			<br><br>
		<</if>>
		<<if _gs.includes("cautious")>>
			"Too close?" <<he>> asks. When you shake your head, <<he>> keeps one hand against the side of your neck while <<he>>
			rinses the soap away with the other.
		<<elseif C.npc.Gwylan.dom gte 50 or _gs.includes("dom")>>
			Gwylan presses two fingers behind your ear to keep your head in place while <<he>> rinses the soap away.
			"Stay there, dear." <<npcincr Gwylan dom 1>>
		<<else>>
			Gwylan gathers another wet handful and works the soap through the ends. "You have a great deal of hair."
		<</if>>
		<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
			<br><br>
			"Don't laugh," you say, keeping your eyes shut.
			<br><br>
			Gwylan keeps working the soap through your hair. "I'm not laughing."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
			<br><br>
			You relax back against <<his>> hands. "Could you keep doing that?"
			<br><br>
			Gwylan reaches for another cup of water. "I wasn't finished."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
			<br><br>
			You tip your head where <<he>> guides it and let <<him>> finish without helping.
		<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
			<br><br>
			"Get soap in my eyes and I'm biting you," you warn.
			<br><br>
			Gwylan laughs and moves the cup away from your face. "I'll keep my fingers clear, then."
		<</if>>
	<<case "fur">>
		You sit on the floor while Gwylan kneels beside you with the comb.
		<<if ["wolf", "cat", "cow", "fox", "bunny", "bear", "kitsune", "okami"].some(tf => Transformations.partActive(tf, "ears"))>>
			Gwylan uses a fine-toothed comb on the fur behind your ears. They twitch away whenever the comb catches.
			<<if Transformations.partActive("bunny", "ears")>>
				<<He>> supports each long ear in <<his>> palm before gently combing along it.
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
		<<if ["wolf", "cat", "fox", "kitsune", "okami"].some(tf => Transformations.partActive(tf, "tail"))>>
			<<He>> lifts your tail into <<his>> lap, supporting it near the base, and works the comb up from the tip,
			stopping when you twitch and starting again once you hold still.
		<<elseif Transformations.partActive("cow", "tail")>>
			<<He>> supports your tail in one hand and combs the tuft at the end, picking the tangles apart before pulling the comb through.
		<<elseif ["bunny", "bear"].some(tf => Transformations.partActive(tf, "tail"))>>
			<<He>> picks the bits of leaf from your short tail with <<his>> fingers, then gently brushes the fur.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<if _gs.includes("cautious")>>
			"Tell me if I pull," <<he>> says. Whenever you tense, <<he>> stops the comb and waits before trying again.
		<<elseif C.npc.Gwylan.dom gte 50 or _gs.includes("dom")>>
			"Hold still, please," <<he>> says when the comb catches another knot. <<He>> works it loose with <<his>> fingers before trying again.
		<<else>>
			<<if ["wolf", "cat", "cow", "fox", "bunny", "bear", "kitsune", "okami"].some(tf => Transformations.partActive(tf, "tail"))>>
				"A bit of leaf," <<he>> says, picking it from your tail and holding it up. "You brought some of the forest in with you."
			<<else>>
				"You've been pushing through every bush you could find," <<he>> says, picking a burr from behind your ear and holding it up. "Look at this."
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
		<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
			<br><br>
			The comb catches another knot and you flinch. "That pulled."
			<br><br>
			Gwylan stops and loosens the knot with <<his>> fingers before putting the comb through it again.
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
			<br><br>
			"Thanks. That was starting to bother me," you say when <<he>> puts the comb down.
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
			<br><br>
			"Don't flatten it all," you say, checking the fur with your hand.
			<br><br>
			Gwylan ruffles it back up before you can do it yourself.
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
			<br><br>
			You keep your head still while <<he>> checks the fur once more for knots <<he>> missed.
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
			<br><br>
			"You missed one," you say, reaching for a knot.
			<br><br>
			Gwylan catches your wrist before you can pull at it. "I saw it. Leave that one to me."
		<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
			<br><br>
			The comb catches and you reach back for it. "Give me that."
			<br><br>
			Gwylan lifts it out of reach. "Hands down, please. I'm nearly finished."
		<</if>>
<</switch>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Gwylan Wash Finish]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Gwylan Wash Finish
<<effects>><<if $NPCList[0]?.fullDescription isnot "Gwylan">><<npc Gwylan>><</if>><<person1>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<set _wash to $gwylan.wash>>
<<unset $gwylan.wash>>
<<switch _wash>>
	<<case "self">>
		Gwylan carries the basin out the back door and tips it over the herb bed. "There. Presentable."
	<<case "hair">>
		Gwylan finishes with a last rinse and wraps the towel round your head. "There. Dry that properly before you go outside."
	<<default>>
		Gwylan sets the comb down and brushes the loose fur off your shoulders. "That's the worst of it gone."
<</switch>>
<br><br>
<<gwylanOptions>>

:: Gwylan Tuck In
<<effects>><<if $NPCList[0]?.fullDescription isnot "Gwylan">><<npc Gwylan>><</if>><<person1>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<set _gs to _gwylanStatus ?? []>>
<<set $gwylan.tuck to { mode: "", day: Time.days }>>
You shift in the pet bed, turn the pillow over, then call Gwylan's name.
<<He>> comes from the back room carrying a lamp with the wick turned low and crouches beside you.
<br><br>
"Still awake?" <<He>> pulls the fuzzy blanket back over your shoulder where it has slipped.
<<if ["wolf", "cat", "fox", "kitsune", "okami"].some(tf => Transformations.partActive(tf, "tail"))>>Your tail has curled round your feet under the blanket.<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Ask for a story|Gwylan Tuck In Done]]>><<set $gwylan.tuck.mode to "story">><<pass 5>><<stress -3>><</link>><<lstress>>
<br>
<<if $gwylanSeen.includesAny("romance", "partners") or _gs.includes("lust")>>
	<<link [[Ask Gwylan to stay until you fall asleep|Gwylan Tuck In Done]]>><<set $gwylan.tuck.mode to "stay">><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<link [[Ask Gwylan to sit by the bed for a while|Gwylan Tuck In Done]]>><<set $gwylan.tuck.mode to "sit">><<pass 5>><<stress -1>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<if $gwylanSeen.includes("partners") or ($gwylanSeen.includes("romance") and C.npc.Gwylan.love gte 25)>>
	<<link [[Ask to sleep at the foot of Gwylan's bed|Gwylan Tuck In Done]]>><<set $gwylan.tuck.mode to "foot">><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Say goodnight|Gwylan Tuck In Done]]>><<set $gwylan.tuck.mode to "quiet">><</link>>
<br>

:: Gwylan Tuck In Done
<<effects>><<if $NPCList[0]?.fullDescription isnot "Gwylan">><<npc Gwylan>><</if>><<person1>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<set _gs to _gwylanStatus ?? []>>
<<switch $gwylan.tuck.mode>>
	<<case "story">>
		<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
			"Could you tell me a story?" you ask, pulling the blanket a little higher. "Just until I get sleepy."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
			You look towards the wall. "Could you... tell me something? A story, I mean."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
			"Would you mind telling me a story before you go?" you ask.
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
			You settle back against the pillow. "I want a story. Something strange, and no sad ending."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
			"Could you tell me a story?" you ask, settling under the blanket. "Anything you like."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
			"Tell me a story before you go," you say, making room for <<him>> on the edge of the bed.
		<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
			"You came all the way over here," you say. "Now you have to tell me a story."
		<<else>>
			"Can you tell me a story?" you ask.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		Gwylan sits on the edge of the bed and thinks. "There was a fox near here that used to steal ribbons from washing lines.
		Red ones only. Nobody knew why, so naturally everyone started hanging out red ribbons just to see where they went."
		<br><br>
		<<He>> gets as far as three gardens, a broken fence and an argument with a farmer before you lose track of who is chasing the fox.
		<<if ["wolf", "cat", "cow", "fox", "bunny", "bear", "waterdragon", "kitsune", "okami"].some(tf => Transformations.partActive(tf, "ears"))>>
			Your ears still twitch whenever <<he>> speaks, even after you stop following the story.
		<</if>>
		<<hypnosisText "Listening to Gwylan makes it harder to keep your eyes open.">>
		<br><br>
		By the time the fox reaches the farmer's last washing line, your eyes are closed. Gwylan lowers the lamp and goes quietly back towards the counter.
		<br><br>
	<<case "stay">>
		<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
			"Could you stay until I fall asleep?" you ask.
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
			"Would you stay with me for a while?" you ask.
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
			You pat the space beside you. "Stay. I sleep better with company."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
			"You can stay, if you want," you say, moving over.
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
			"Stay with me until I fall asleep," you say.
		<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
			"Don't go yet," you say, grabbing <<his>> sleeve.
		<<else>>
			"Will you stay until I fall asleep?" you ask.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		Gwylan hesitates, then smiles. "Shift over, then." <<He>> turns the lamp down, climbs in behind you, and pulls the blanket over you both.
		<<set $bedGuest to "Gwylan">><<set $gwylanbed to true>>
		<<if _gs.includes("cautious")>>
			"Tell me if I'm too close," <<he>> says. You shake your head, and <<he>> settles behind you without moving any closer.
		<<elseif C.npc.Gwylan.dom gte 50 or _gs.includes("dom")>>
			<<He>> puts an arm around your ribs and pulls you back against <<him>>, then tucks the blanket over your shoulder.
			"Go to sleep, <<pcpetname "Gwylan" "my">>. I've got you."
		<<else>>
			<<He>> hums under <<his>> breath and rests an arm over you. When you shift closer, <<he>> keeps humming.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		You are asleep before you notice it happening.
		<br><br>
	<<case "sit">>
		<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
			"Could you sit here for a bit?" you ask, pointing to the chair.
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
			"Would you keep me company for a few minutes?" you ask.
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
			"Sit with me until I get bored of being awake," you say.
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
			"You don't have to stay long," you say. "Just sit nearby."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
			"Sit here a while," you say.
		<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
			"You're the one who tucked me in. You can keep me company too," you say.
		<<else>>
			"Can you sit here for a while?" you ask.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		Gwylan sits in the chair beside the bed and opens the ledger to the herb stock. "I can count very slowly," <<he>> says.
		<br><br>
		<<He>> reads a few entries under <<his>> breath, waiting between each one until your eyes start to close.
		<br><br>
	<<case "foot">>
		<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
			"Could I sleep at the foot of your bed tonight?" you ask.
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
			"Would you let me sleep at the foot of your bed tonight?" you ask.
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
			You point towards the stairs. "Your bed, but only the foot of it. I want to try it."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
			"Can I sleep at the foot of your bed tonight?" you ask, waiting for <<his>> answer.
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
			"Let me sleep at the foot of your bed tonight," you say.
		<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
			"I want your bed," you say. "Only the foot. You can keep the rest."
		<<else>>
			"Can I sleep at the foot of your bed tonight?" you ask.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		Gwylan looks at the stairs, then back at you. "The foot of my bed?" <<He>> studies your face. "You're sure you want to sleep there?"
		<br><br>
		<<if _gs.includes("cautious")>>
			<<He>> watches your face before offering a hand. "All right. If you change your mind, wake me and we'll come back down."
		<<elseif C.npc.Gwylan.dom gte 50 or _gs.includes("dom")>>
			<<He>> holds out a hand. "Come on, then. You can have the foot."
		<<else>>
			<<He>> chuckles. "I was going to say the pet bed is already yours, but now I'm curious." <<He>> holds out <<his>> hand. "Come on."
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		Gwylan leads you upstairs. <<He>> turns back the blankets at the foot of <<his>> bed and pats the mattress once.
		You climb up and settle crosswise at the foot of the bed while Gwylan gets in beneath the blankets.<<if ["wolf", "cat", "fox", "kitsune", "okami"].some(tf => Transformations.partActive(tf, "tail"))>><br><br>
		Your tail brushes the blankets before curling against your leg.<</if>>
		<<set $bedGuest to "Gwylan">><<set $gwylanbed to true>>
		<br><br>
	<<default>>
		"Goodnight, <<pcpetname "Gwylan" "simple">>," <<he>> says, lowering the lamp before walking back towards the counter.
		You pull the blanket up and settle down.
		<br><br>
<</switch>>
<<link [[Next|Forest Shop Dog Bed]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Gwylan Leash Post
<<effects>><<if $NPCList[0]?.fullDescription isnot "Gwylan">><<npc Gwylan>><</if>><<person1>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<set $daily.gwylan.leashPost to true>>
<<set $gwylan.post to { leashed: $worn.neck.type.includes("leash") }>>
<<if !$gwylan.post.leashed>>
	Gwylan touches your collar, drawing out a glowing leash.<<attach_leash>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
	"Gwylan... if you're busy, I could wait outside," you say, holding the loose end of the leash towards <<him>>. "You could tie me to the porch."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
	You lay the leash on the counter instead of putting it in <<his>> hand. "If you need me out of the way, I could wait outside. On this."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
	"Would it help if I waited on the porch while you work?" you ask, offering <<him>> the leash. "You can tie me there."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
	You stretch the leash across the counter. "I have an idea. Tie me to the porch and see how well I behave."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You step close and place the end of the leash in Gwylan's hand. "If you want me outside, I'll stay there."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"Leave me on the porch," you say, holding out the end. "I'll be where you left me."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"Think I can't sit still?" you ask, dropping the leash into <<his>> hand. "Tie me up outside and see how long I last."
<<else>>
	"If you're busy, I can wait on the porch," you say. "On the leash."
<</if>>
<br><br>
Gwylan takes the leash and looks towards the porch. "You'd like me to leave you out there?" <<He>> gives the lead a gentle tug.
When you do not change your mind, <<he>> nods. "All right. I'll be just inside with the kettle. Stay on the porch until I come back."
<br><br>
<<if $worn.neck.name is "familiar collar">>
	<<He>> walks you out to the porch and hooks the glowing leash over the post. It stays there without any knot, and the collar warms against your throat.
<<else>>
	<<He>> walks you out to the porch and ties the leash round the post with a tight knot, then gives it a firm pull to check it.
<</if>>
<<if $hypnosis_traits.devotion gte 1>>
	<<hypnosisText "You feel pulled to the spot as well as tied to it.">>
<</if>>
<br><br>
Gwylan goes back inside and leaves the shop door open. Through the window, you can see <<him>> set the kettle on the stove and return to the ledger behind the counter.
<br><br>
<<link [[Sit on the step|Gwylan Leash Post Wait]]>><<set $gwylan.post.pose to "sit">><<set $outside to 1>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Stand and wait|Gwylan Leash Post Wait]]>><<set $gwylan.post.pose to "stand">><<set $outside to 1>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Test the leash at once|Gwylan Leash Post Wait]]>><<set $gwylan.post.pose to "test">><<set $outside to 1>><<pass 5>><</link>><<gwylanWillpowerDifficulty>>
<br>

:: Gwylan Leash Post Wait
<<effects>><<if $NPCList[0]?.fullDescription isnot "Gwylan">><<npc Gwylan>><</if>><<person1>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<set _pose to $gwylan.post.pose>>
<<if !$gwylan.post.ev>>
	<<if _pose is "test">>
		<<if $hypnosis_traits.devotion gte 1 and !$willpowerSuccess>>
			You take hold of the leash to test it, but your knees bend before you can pull. <<hypnosisText "The order to stay keeps you on the step.">>
			<br><br>
			Through the window, Gwylan keeps writing in the ledger.
			<<set $gwylan.post.pose to "sit">>
		<<else>>
			You give the leash two hard pulls, but it stays fixed to the post. Through the window, Gwylan keeps writing as you sit down to wait on your own terms.
			<<set $gwylan.post.pose to "sit">>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<set _evPool to (Time.dayState is "night" ? ["quiet", "animal"] : ["quiet", "photo", "helper", "animal"])>>
	<<set $gwylan.post.ev to _evPool.random()>>
<</if>>
<<switch $gwylan.post.ev>>
	<<case "quiet">>
		No one comes up the path while you wait.
		<br><br>
		<<if $gwylan.post.pose is "sit">> After a while, the edge of the step starts pressing into your legs.<<else>>
		Your feet begin to ache from standing in one place.<</if>><<if ["wolf", "cat", "cow", "fox", "bunny", "bear", "waterdragon", "kitsune", "okami"].some(tf => Transformations.partActive(tf, "ears"))>>
		Your ears twitch towards footsteps farther down the path and rustling in the trees.<</if>><<if ["wolf", "cat", "cow", "fox", "bunny", "bear", "bird", "waterdragon", "demon", "kitsune", "okami"].some(tf => Transformations.partActive(tf, "tail"))>>
		Your tail moves behind you when the smell of tea reaches the porch.<</if>>
		<br><br>
		When you look through the window, Gwylan is still behind the ledger. <<He>> drops <<his>> eyes to the page as soon as you catch <<him>> watching.
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Wave at the window|Gwylan Leash Post Return]]>><<set $gwylan.post.res to 1>><<pass 20>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Hold your pose and wait|Gwylan Leash Post Return]]>><<set $gwylan.post.res to 2>><<pass 20>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Close your eyes and listen|Gwylan Leash Post Return]]>><<set $gwylan.post.res to 3>><<pass 20>><<stress -3>><</link>><<lstress>>
	<<case "photo">>
		A walker comes up the path and slows when they see the leash running from your collar to the porch post.
		They look towards the shop door, pull out a phone and raise it towards you without asking.
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Turn away and cover your face|Gwylan Leash Post Return]]>><<set $gwylan.post.res to 1>><<stress 6>><<pass 15>><</link>><<gstress>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Meet the lens and hold still|Gwylan Leash Post Return]]>><<set $gwylan.post.res to 2>><<trauma 3>><<stress 3>><<pass 15>><</link>><<gtrauma>><<gstress>>
		<br>
		<<if hasSexStat("exhibitionism", 3)>>
			<<link [[Pose for it|Gwylan Leash Post Return]]>><<set $gwylan.post.res to 3>><<pass 15>><</link>><<exhibitionist3>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<link [[Tell them to stop|Gwylan Leash Post Return]]>><<set $gwylan.post.res to 4>><<stress 3>><<pass 15>><</link>><<gstress>>
	<<case "helper">>
		Footsteps approach along the path. A walker slows at the bottom of the porch steps when they notice the leash.
		"Are you all right?" They look through the open shop door, then come closer and reach for the leash.
		<br><br>
		<<if $worn.neck.name is "familiar collar">>
			The glowing leash slips through their fingers and settles back around the post. The walker jerks their hand away.
		<<else>>
			They pick at the knot, but Gwylan has pulled it too tight. After a few seconds they look up at you. "Did someone tie this on purpose?"
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Let them keep trying|Gwylan Leash Post Return]]>><<set $gwylan.post.res to 1>><<pass 10>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Tell them you're fine, and that Gwylan is coming|Gwylan Leash Post Return]]>><<set $gwylan.post.res to 2>><<pass 10>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Say nothing and look at the ground|Gwylan Leash Post Return]]>><<set $gwylan.post.res to 3>><<stress 3>><<pass 10>><</link>><<gstress>>
	<<default>>
		<<if effectiveTransformationLevel("wolf") gte 6>>
			A grey wolf watches from the tree line. When you turn towards it, it comes a few steps closer and sniffs the air.
			<<if Transformations.partActive("wolf", "tail")>> Your tail starts wagging before you can stop it.<</if>> Its eyes move from the leash to your face.
		<<else>>
			A grey wolf watches from the tree line. It comes a few steps closer when you notice it,
			sniffing the air before looking at the leash tied to the post.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Stay perfectly still|Gwylan Leash Post Return]]>><<set $gwylan.post.res to 1>><<stress 6>><<pass 10>><</link>><<gstress>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Stare it down|Gwylan Leash Post Return]]>><<set $gwylan.post.res to 2>><<pass 10>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Call for Gwylan|Gwylan Leash Post Return]]>><<set $gwylan.post.res to 3>><<stress 3>><<pass 10>><</link>><<gstress>>
		<br>
		<<if effectiveTransformationLevel("wolf") gte 6>>
			<<link [[Greet it like one of the pack|Gwylan Leash Post Return]]>><<set $gwylan.post.res to 4>><<pass 10>><</link>><<wolfgirl>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
<</switch>>
<br>

:: Gwylan Leash Post Return
<<effects>><<if $NPCList[0]?.fullDescription isnot "Gwylan">><<npc Gwylan>><</if>><<person1>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<set _ev to $gwylan.post.ev>>
<<set _res to $gwylan.post.res>>
<<switch _ev>>
	<<case "quiet">>
		<<if _res is 1>>
			You raise a hand towards the window. Gwylan lowers the ledger and, caught watching, gives you a small wave back.
		<<elseif _res is 2>>
			You keep the same pose until your shoulders ache. By the time Gwylan opens the door, you are still exactly where <<he>> left you.
		<<else>>
			You close your eyes and <<if $gwylan.post.pose is "sit">>rest your hands in your lap<<else>>let your arms hang at your sides<</if>>. Your shoulders loosen as you stop checking the path every few seconds.
			<br><br>
			<<if $hypnosis_traits.devotion gte 1>> <<hypnosisText "The warm collar reminds you of Gwylan's order, and staying on the porch feels easy.">><</if>>
			You only notice the door opening when Gwylan steps onto the porch.
		<</if>>
	<<case "photo">>
		<<if _res is 1>>
			You turn your face into your shoulder and bring one arm up between you and the phone. The walker hesitates, lowers it, and goes on up the path.
		<<elseif _res is 2>>
			You look straight into the lens and stay where Gwylan left you. The walker takes the picture, gives you an awkward nod,
			then continues up the path.
		<<elseif _res is 3>>
			You angle yourself towards the camera and let the leash show across your chest. The walker takes three pictures, mouths a quick "thanks",
			and hurries away.
		<<else>>
			<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
				"Please don't," you say, covering your face. "Put it away."
			<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
				"Please stop taking pictures of me," you say. "I didn't say you could."
			<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
				"No pictures," you say, pointing up the path. "You can keep walking."
			<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
				You press back against the post and raise a hand. "Please stop. I don't want a picture."
			<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
				"Put the phone down," you say. "Now."
			<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
				"Put it away before I get off this leash and do it for you," you say.
			<<else>>
				"Stop," you say. "Don't take pictures of me."
			<</if>>
			<br><br>
			The walker lowers the phone, mutters an apology, and goes on without looking back.
		<</if>>
	<<case "helper">>
		<<if _res is 1>>
			<<if $worn.neck.name is "familiar collar">>
				The walker tries to lift the glowing leash from the post, but their fingers pass through it. "Sorry," they say, stepping back. "I can't get hold of it."
			<<else>>
				The walker keeps trying the knot until their fingers slip off it again. "Sorry," they say, stepping back. "That's tighter than it looks."
			<</if>>
		<<elseif _res is 2>>
			<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
				"I'm all right," you say. "Gwylan's coming back. I asked to wait here."
			<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
				"Thank you, but I'm fine," you say. "Gwylan will be back soon."
			<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
				"I'm not stuck," you say, lifting the leash. "I asked Gwylan to put me here."
			<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
				"I'm meant to stay here," you say. "Gwylan will come back for me."
			<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
				"I'm fine. Leave it," you say. "I chose this."
			<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
				"Stop fussing with it," you say. "I asked Gwylan to tie me here."
			<<else>>
				"I'm fine," you say. "Gwylan will be back soon."
			<</if>>
			<br><br>
			The walker looks from you to the shop door, still uncertain, but finally lets go of the leash and backs away.
		<<else>>
			You look at the ground. The walker waits for an answer, reaches uncertainly towards the leash once more, then leaves you alone.
		<</if>>
	<<default>>
		<<if _res is 1>>
			You hold perfectly still while the wolf circles the post. You can hear it breathing as it passes,
			but it never touches you before returning to the trees.
		<<elseif _res is 2>>
			You meet the wolf's eyes and refuse to look away. It watches you for a while, yawns, then turns and trots back into the trees.
		<<elseif _res is 3>>
			"Gwylan!" you call. The wolf flinches, and the door bangs open. The wolf is gone before Gwylan has finished stepping onto the porch.
		<<else>>
			You lower your head and breathe out, the way a pack-mate would. The wolf comes close and sniffs your cheek before moving to the collar.
			It sneezes at the smell, then turns back towards the trees.
		<</if>>
<</switch>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Gwylan Leash Post Back]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Gwylan Leash Post Back
<<effects>><<if $NPCList[0]?.fullDescription isnot "Gwylan">><<npc Gwylan>><</if>><<person1>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<set _gs to _gwylanStatus ?? []>>
<<set _ev to $gwylan.post.ev>>
<<set _res to $gwylan.post.res>>
<<set _push to (C.npc.Gwylan.dom gte 50 or _gs.includesAny("dom", "lust"))>>
<<if _ev is "animal" and _res is 3>>
	Gwylan checks the tree line, then goes inside and returns with two mugs.
<<elseif _ev isnot "quiet" or _res is 1>>
	The door opens, and Gwylan steps onto the porch carrying two mugs.
<<else>>
	<<Hes>> already standing there with two mugs.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<switch _ev>>
	<<case "photo">>
		<<if _push>>
			Gwylan looks up the path after the walker. "Were they taking pictures of you?"
		<<else>>
			Gwylan looks up the path. "Was that a camera?" <<He>> turns back to you. "Did they ask?"
		<</if>>
	<<case "helper">>
		<<if _push>>
			Gwylan looks at the leash, then up the path the walker took. <<His>> smile drops. "Who was touching my leash?"
		<<else>>
			"Did someone try to untie you?" Gwylan looks up the path after the walker, then starts laughing. "I suppose you did look stranded."
		<</if>>
	<<case "animal">>
		<<if _push>>
			<<He>> glances at the tree line and back at you. "It's been watching you since I left you here. I'd have shooed it off, but I wanted to see what you'd do."
		<<else>>
			<<He>> looks towards the trees without reaching for the leash. "That one's been at the tree line all week. It likes to check on my garden." <<He>> looks back at you. "It didn't frighten you, I hope."
		<</if>>
	<<default>>
		<<if _push>>
			Gwylan checks the collar, runs two fingers down the leash, then nods. "Still where I left you."
		<<else>>
			Gwylan checks the clock and winces. "I said I'd be quick. I'm sorry. The kettle took ages."
		<</if>>
<</switch>>
<br><br>
<<if _ev is "photo" and _res is 3>>
	<<if _push>>
		Gwylan raises <<his>> eyebrows. "You posed for them? On my leash?" <<He>> starts laughing as <<he>> gathers the loose lead into <<his>> hand.
	<<else>>
		"You posed for them?" Gwylan asks. <<He>> looks up the path, then starts laughing. "I leave you alone for one kettle."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
<<elseif _ev is "animal" and _res is 4>>
	<<if _push>>
		"It came that close?" Gwylan asks, glancing towards the trees. <<He>> checks the collar before loosening the leash.
	<<else>>
		Gwylan looks towards the trees. "It normally gets closer to the garden than that. Maybe you distracted it."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<set _held to ((_ev is "quiet" and _res gte 2) or (_ev is "photo" and _res is 2) or (_ev is "helper" and _res lte 2) or (_ev is "animal" and (_res is 1 or _res is 2)))>>
<<if $hypnosis_traits.devotion gte 1 and _push>>
	<<if _held>>
		<<He>> hands you a mug and starts unlooping the leash. "<<gwylanCommand "Look at you, still exactly where I left you." 1>>"
		<br><br>
		<<hypnosisText "Your shoulders drop at the praise, and you want to hear it again.">> <<He>> scratches behind your ear before letting the leash fall.
		<<stress -6>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		<<He>> hands you a mug while <<he>> loosens the leash. You wait for the praise that normally follows, but it never comes.
		<br><br>
		<<hypnosisText "You notice at once that the word is missing.">> "You got distracted," Gwylan says. "We'll try it again another day."
		<<stress 3>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
<<elseif _push>>
	<<if _held>>
		Gwylan unloops the leash but keeps hold of the end while <<he>> hands you a mug. "You really did stay put."
		<br><br>
		<<He>> gives the lead a light pull before letting it hang loose. <<npcincr Gwylan dom 1>><<stress -3>><<lstress>><<gdom>>
	<<else>>
		<<He>> gives you the mug and frees the leash.
		<br><br>
		"You lasted longer than I expected." Gwylan glances towards whatever distracted you. "Next time I'll know what to watch for."
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<if _held>>
		<<He>> frees the leash and sits beside you on the step before passing you a mug.
		<br><br>
		"You really waited the whole time." Gwylan sounds surprised, and <<he>> nudges your knee with <<his>> own. <<stress -6>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		<<He>> unties you and passes you a mug. "I leave you alone for one kettle and something happens."
		<br><br>
		<<He>> sits beside you and checks your face. "Are you all right?" <<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<set $gwylan.post.held to _held>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Gwylan Leash Post End]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Gwylan Leash Post End
<<effects>><<if $NPCList[0]?.fullDescription isnot "Gwylan">><<npc Gwylan>><</if>><<person1>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<set _held to $gwylan.post.held>>
<<if !$gwylan.post.leashed>><<detach_leash>><</if>>
<<unset $gwylan.post>>
You both settle on the step with your mugs while the steam drifts up past the porch rail.
<<if _held and (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	<br><br>
	"I wanted to see if I could stay there the whole time," you say, rubbing the place where the collar sat.
	<br><br>
	Gwylan gives your shoulder a squeeze while you hold the mug.
<<elseif _held and _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
	<br><br>
	"Thanks for the tea," you say, warming your hands around the mug.
	<br><br>
	Gwylan looks into <<his>> own mug. "It took a little longer than I expected. I hope it was worth the wait."
<<elseif _held and _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
	<br><br>
	"I think that earned me another drink," you say.
	<br><br>
	Gwylan looks into <<his>> own mug, then passes it to you.
<<elseif _held and _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	<br><br>
	You take the mug in both hands. "I stayed where you put me."
	<br><br>
	Gwylan checks the collar with two fingers, then pets the top of your head.
<<elseif _held and _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	<br><br>
	"Told you I'd still be here," you say.
	<br><br>
	Gwylan gives the loose leash one last tug before letting it drop.
<<elseif _held and (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	<br><br>
	"You looked through the window the whole time," you say.
	<br><br>
	Gwylan looks back at the ledger, then takes a drink instead of answering.
<</if>>
<br><br>
When the mugs are empty, Gwylan gathers them up and carries them inside. You follow <<him>> back into the shop.<<set $outside to 0>>
<br><br>
<<gwylanOptions>>
